# Popcorn Cinnamon Sugar

{ rating="2" image="popcorn_cinnamon_sugar.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 1/4 cup [kernels]{ ing="kernels" }
- [ ] ~1 Tbsp [butter]{ ing="butter" }
- [ ] ~1 tsp [cinnamon]{ ing="cinnamon" }
- [ ] ~2 tsp [sugar]{ ing="sugar" }

## Recipe

1. Place in popper and cook for 2:20 in our 900 watt microwave
1. Microwave the [butter]{ ing="butter" } until softened then mix with the popcorn. Coat with the [cinnamon]{ ing="cinnamon" } and [sugar]{ ing="sugar" }

## Notes

1. Measurements are all estimates
